{"id":"torrey:mule-the","source":"torrey","name":"Mule, The","slug":"mule-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"First mention of — Ge 36:24.","refs":[["Gen",36,24,36,24]]},{"text":"Stupid and intractable — Ps 32:9.","refs":[["Ps",32,9,32,9]]},{"text":"Riding, by persons of distinction. — 2Sa 13:29; 18:9; 1Ki 1:33.","refs":[["2Sam",13,29,13,29],["2Sam",18,9,18,9],["1Kgs",1,33,1,33]]},{"text":"Carrying burdens. — 2Ki 5:17; 1Ch 12:40.","refs":[["2Kgs",5,17,5,17],["1Chr",12,40,12,40]]},{"text":"Conveying posts and messengers. — Es 8:10,14.","refs":[["Esth",8,10,8,10],["Esth",8,14,8,14]]},{"text":"Liable to the plague — Zec 14:15.","refs":[["Zech",14,15,14,15]]},{"text":"Food of — 1Ki 4:28; 18:5.","refs":[["1Kgs",4,28,4,28],["1Kgs",18,5,18,5]]},{"text":"Forbidden to breed. — Le 19:19.","refs":[["Lev",19,19,19,19]]},{"text":"Set a great value upon. — 1Ki 18:5.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,5,18,5]]},{"text":"Brought many, from Babylon. — Ezr 2:66.","refs":[["Ezra",2,66,2,66]]},{"text":"Shall used, at the restoration. — Isa 66:20.","refs":[["Isa",66,20,66,20]]},{"text":"Of Togarmah, sold in fairs of Tyre — Eze 27:14.","refs":[["Ezek",27,14,27,14]]},{"text":"Often given as tribute — 1Ki 10:25.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,25,10,25]]}],"refCount":18}
